# A core with no machine before its first frame: until console 0's first
# retro_run, its retro_unserialize loads nothing and says it did
# (link_test_mode cold_load). Without warm=1 the from run's load reaches
# no machine, and the save right after it writes the one of frame 0.
# error: console 0: a save right after the load differs at byte 4 from the state it loaded
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_render soft
option 0 link_test_mode cold_load
option 0 link_test_seed 3
option 1 link_test_seed 7
0 cable 0:0 1:0
60 save mid
60 checkpoint in_flight
90 checkpoint later
120 end
